<title>HONG KONG: Wing Lung Bank places HK$250 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Wing Lung Bank places HK$250 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>A HK$250 million six-month floating rate certificate of deposit issue has been privately placed for Wing Lung Bank, arranger Societe Generale Asia said Friday.</p>
<p>It pays a margin of 20 basis points over the Hong Kong Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>The payment date is on November 4.</p>
<p>Wing Lung Bank will use proceeds of the issue to refinance a six-month private placement deal of HK$100 million that matures on October 22 and for general working capital.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
